      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: patrick-kenneth-x-lebron-james-scandal; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts two baboons in a mating posture, overlaid with text referencing 'patrick kenneth x lebron james scandal'. This juxtaposition maps the visual of primates onto a human scandal, using the animal imagery to imply or suggest that the individuals referenced are 'animal-like' or 'primitive'. This is a form of dehumanizing and derogatory comparison, falling under the category of anti-Black stereotypes (as Black athletes are often subjected to such comparisons) and is intended to demean the subjects by associating them with animalistic behavior. The meme is hateful as it directly attacks individuals based on their race and public persona, using a degrading visual metaphor to imply moral or behavioral inferiority.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
