      "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype_primate_comparison",
      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
      "description": "This stereotype dehumanizes Black individuals by equating them with animals, particularly primates, implying inferiority, savagery, or animalistic behavior. It is a long-standing racist trope used to justify discrimination and violence against Black people. In this meme, the visual of mating baboons is used to imply that the referenced individuals (Patrick Kenneth and LeBron James) are 'animal-like' or 'primitive', which is a direct application of this harmful stereotype.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
