      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "Dehumanizing comparison of Patrick Kenneth and LeBron James to mating baboons",
      "description": "The text 'patrick kenneth x lebron james scandal' is mapped onto the visual of two baboons in a mating posture. This mapping implies that the individuals referenced in the text are being compared to the baboons, suggesting they are 'animal-like' or 'primitive'. This is a dehumanizing analogy used to demean the subjects by associating them with animalistic behavior, which is a form of anti-Black racial stereotyping.",
