      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_578fc82a",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target audience consists of individuals who are familiar with or interested in the public personas of Patrick Kenneth and LeBron James, particularly those who are aware of or have opinions about the referenced 'scandal'. The meme is designed to appeal to viewers who understand the racialized stereotype of comparing Black people to primates and who may find humor or satisfaction in dehumanizing portrayals of Black public figures. The audience likely includes online communities that engage in racially charged or degrading humor, particularly those that use animal imagery to mock Black athletes or celebrities. The meme's toxicity and reliance on anti-Black stereotypes suggest it is intended for an audience that either perpetuates or finds amusement in such racist tropes.",
